UPDATE companies SET description='Cable Manufacturing Technologies, operating as CMT Cables, was founded in 1999 and is headquartered in Roseville, California. The company was established by partners with combined decades of experience in cable manufacturing across the United States, China, and Taiwan, positioning itself as a global supplier of cable assemblies, wiring harnesses, and stock cable products.

