UPDATE companies SET description='Cable Technology Inc was established in June 1982 in Willington, Connecticut, for the purpose of manufacturing plastic-insulated wire and cable for the electronic industry. The founding aimed to supply the growing electronics sector with reliable hook-up wire and multi-conductor cable solutions.

