UPDATE companies SET description='Cal-Chip Electronics, Inc. operates from Warminster, Pennsylvania, where it has built over 35 years of experience as a specialist in surface mounted devices. The company describes itself as a manufacturer and supplier of passive surface mount components, emphasizing a commitment to zero-defect quality and on-time delivery.

The company manufactures and stocks a broad range of passive surface mount components, including ceramic and polymer multilayer chip capacitors, tantalum and aluminum electrolytic capacitors, thick- and thin-film chip resistors, automotive-grade and current-sensing resistors, multilayer and wire-wound chip inductors, power inductors, and ferrite beads.

Cal-Chip serves the electronics manufacturing sector, particularly companies producing printed circuit boards for commercial, automotive, and other applications that require high-density surface mount assemblies. Its product range includes automotive-grade resistors and other components qualified for demanding environments.

