UPDATE companies SET description='Calmont Wire & Cable was founded in 1958 in Santa Ana, California, by Bill Chilcote, who started the company with an extruder producing tubing for the Hula Hoop craze. The privately held firm quickly pivoted to aerospace and military markets, solving wire and cable challenges for emerging technologies.

Today, Calmont designs, manufactures, and tests custom wire and cable from its southern California facilities, offering on-demand inventory and reverse-engineered replacement cables for medical device repair. The company handles prototyping, short runs, and long runs, with capabilities spanning custom engineering, sterilization-resistant designs, and solutions for extreme environments such as cryogenics and space.

Calmont serves medical (including implants, robotics, and surgical devices), aerospace (Apollo, Space Shuttle, Hubble Telescope), military and defense, robotics, communications, and testing and measurement industries.

The company emphasizes accessibility—customers speak directly with wire and cable experts—and a culture of continuous improvement that has yielded a 99.4% customer acceptance rate. Calmont positions itself as a problem-solving partner willing to tackle difficult, never-been-run jobs, with a mission to bring manufacturing back to the United States.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','AS9100D']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom wire and cable design", "Custom cable manufacturing", "Cable testing", "On-demand inventory management", "Reverse engineering of replacement cables", "Custom engineering", "Prototyping", "Short-run production", "Long-run production", "Design for extreme environments", "Sterilization-resistant cable design", "Medical device cable design", "Aerospace cable design", "Military cable design"], "industries": ["Medical", "Aerospace", "Military", "Robotics", "Communications", "Testing and Measurement", "Medical Device Repair", "Medical Implants", "Medical Robotics", "Aerospace Wire and Cable", "Defense"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Extruder (historical)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["99.4% customer acceptance rate", "Direct access to wire and cable experts by phone", "Willingness to tackle difficult jobs others decline", "Custom engineering for never-been-run products", "On-demand inventory from southern California facilities"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1958 by Bill Chilcote -> /about", "Headquarters Santa Ana, California -> db", "Privately held since 1958 -> /about", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, ISO 13485:2016, AS9100D -> /about", "Industries: Medical, Aerospace, Military, Robotics, Communications, Testing & Measurement -> / and /about", "Capabilities: custom design, manufacturing, testing, on-demand inventory, reverse engineering, prototyping, short/long runs -> /about", "99.4% customer acceptance rate -> /about", "Direct access to experts -> /about", "Willingness to tackle diff