UPDATE companies SET description='Collision Auto Parts, headquartered in Albuquerque, New Mexico, traces its roots to 2005 when National Auto Parts began serving Northern California. The company rebranded to Collision Auto Parts (COL) and now operates as three entities running distribution facilities across California and New Mexico.

