UPDATE companies SET description='Columbus Woodworks operates from Lynchburg, Virginia, where it has manufactured custom wood storm doors and screen doors since 1991. The company was incorporated as Columbus Woodworks, Inc., and has built a reputation as a quality‑oriented manufacturer serving both residential and commercial markets.

