UPDATE companies SET description='Commercial Furniture Company was founded in 2021 in Scottsdale, Arizona, by Jenni Muñiz. A family-owned and locally operated business, it began with Muñiz’s background in marketing and project management after graduating from Arizona State University’s Walter Cronkite School of Journalism. She set out to help Arizona businesses succeed by creating high-performing commercial spaces that balance form, function, and budget.

The company operates as a full-service commercial furniture dealer, providing furniture procurement, space planning, interior design, project management, installation and moving, warranty service management, and financing. It leverages partnerships with North American contract-grade furniture manufacturers to supply cubicles, private offices, ergonomic chairs, standing desks, and complete workspace solutions. A quick-ship catalog offers fast, budget-sensitive options. The firm coordinates logistics from multiple manufacturers, handles permits, and manages vendor payments, serving the Phoenix metropolitan area.

Clients range from small and mid-sized businesses to medical facilities, hospitality venues, senior living centers, behavioral health organizations, multi-family housing, community clubhouses, and golf resorts. Notable projects include a brewery in Gilbert, Arizona, and various medical offices throughout Scottsdale, Phoenix, Mesa, Gilbert, Chandler, and surrounding communities.

The company emphasizes value engineering, integrity, cooperation, empathy, and efficiency. Its stated differentiator is rethinking the furniture purchasing system to deliver superior-quality products quickly at affordable prices, backed by a family-first approach and a network of local designers, architects, and contractors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Furniture procurement", "Space planning and consulting", "Interior design services", "Project management", "Installation and moving services", "Warranty service management", "Financing and budget development", "Quick-ship furniture catalog"], "industries": ["Office / corporate", "Medical facilities", "Hospitality", "Senior living", "Multi-family residential", "Community spaces", "Behavioral health", "Golf resorts", "Hotel lobbies", "Clubhouses"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Rethinking the furniture purchasing system to deliver superior-quality products quickly at affordable prices", "Family-owned, locally operated, results-driven approach", "Value engineering maximizing commercial design opportunities with the client\u2019s bottom line in mind", "Quick-ship catalog for fast, budget-sensitive product offerings", "Warranty service management and financing through Quail Financial Solutions"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2021 -> db", "Founder Jenni Mu\u00f1iz -> /about", "Family-owned -> /", "Locally operated in Scottsdale, AZ -> /", "Services: furniture procurement, space planning, design, project management, installation, warranty, financing -> /services", "Industries served: medical facilities, hospitality, senior living, multi-family, community spaces, offices -> /services", "Quick-ship catalog -> /", "Partnership with Quail Financial Solutions for financing -> /", "Serves Phoenix metropolitan area -> /", "Project example: Wicked Rain Brewery in Gilbert, AZ -> /about", "Network of manufacturers, designers, architects,