UPDATE companies SET description='Creative Woodworks, Inc. was founded in 2001 in West Valley City, Utah, by Jose and Jeremias, the sons of a couple who ran a small custom furniture and cabinetry shop. The business remains family-owned, now spanning three generations of cabinetmaking experience.

The company designs, fabricates, and installs high-end custom cabinetry for luxury residences. Combining old-world craftsmanship with modern technology, Creative Woodworks has completed over 1,000 projects in its 24-plus years of operation. The shop handles detailed cabinet drawings, fabrication, and on-site installation, often collaborating closely with builders and designers throughout the process.

Primary customers include custom home builders such as Don Jones and Douglas Knight Construction, as well as interior designers like L. Ashton. Projects range from gourmet kitchens and bars to bathroom vanities and specialty pieces such as elaborate bunk beds, all tailored to high-end residential clients.

The founders emphasize that the company differentiates itself through the customer experience, not just the product. Rooted in principles taught by Jose’s mother—listening closely to client needs—the team aims to make every step from design to final touch-ups memorable. The family’s hands-on involvement and pride in craftsmanship are cited as key reasons clients return.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry design", "Cabinet fabrication", "Installation", "Design collaboration with builders and designers", "Detailed cabinet drawings and detailing", "Custom furniture fabrication", "Project management"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "High-end residential", "Custom home building", "Interior design", "Luxury home building"], "materials": ["Oak", "Walnut"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Old-world craftsmanship combined with state-of-the-art technology", "Customer experience prioritized from design through installation", "Three generations of family cabinetmaking expertise", "Over 1,000 custom projects completed", "Hands-on involvement of family owners in every project"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2001 -> db", "Headquarters West Valley City, Utah -> db", "Family-owned, three generations -> /about", "Founders Jose and Jeremias -> /about", "Custom cabinetry design, fabrication, installation -> / and /about", "1,000+ projects completed -> /about", "24+ years in business -> /about", "Serves builders (Don Jones, Douglas Knight Construction) and designers (L. Ashton) -> /", "Materials: oak, walnut -> /", "Old-world craftsmanship with state-of-the-art technology -> /about", "Customer experience focus -> /about", "Instagram @creativewoodworks.inc -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Creative Woodworks began with a couple who owned a small custom furniture and cabinetry shop", "founded_year": "2001", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": 