UPDATE companies SET description='Cummins Inc. was founded in 1919 in Columbus, Indiana.

Today Cummins designs and manufactures diesel, natural gas, and alternative-fuel engines, fully integrated generator sets, transfer switches, switchgear, and a range of components including emission solutions, automated transmissions, and drivetrain systems. Its Accelera brand delivers zero-emission power systems, while the company''s global network comprises more than 9,000 service locations.

The company serves construction, power generation, marine, industrial, and mining sectors. Concrete examples include powering Digital Realty data centers, supporting Polish rail modernization projects, and developing hybrid diesel-battery mining trucks. Cummins also supplies public transit agencies and has marked 100 years of service to the global mining industry.

Cummins differentiates itself through its "Power Onward" strategy, which spans diesel, natural gas, hybrid, electric, and biofuel technologies, and its "Destination Zero" pledge to reduce emissions across the product lifecycle. The firm emphasizes integrated power solutions backed by deep technical expertise and a worldwide support footprint.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Diesel engine manufacturing", "Natural gas engine manufacturing", "Alternative fuel engine manufacturing", "Generator set assembly", "Transfer switch manufacturing", "Switchgear manufacturing", "Engine component manufacturing", "Emission solutions", "Automated transmission manufacturing", "Drivetrain and braking systems", "Zero-emission power solutions (Accelera)", "Hybrid power systems", "Electric power systems", "Biofuel-compatible engines", "Power system integration", "Global service and support"], "industries": ["Construction", "Power Generation", "Marine", "Industrial", "Mining", "Data Centers", "Public Transit", "Rail"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["9,000+ service locations worldwide", "100 years of mining power solutions", "Full portfolio from diesel to zero-emission (Accelera)", "Integrated power systems with technical expertise", "Global support network across product lifecycle"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1919 in Columbus, Indiana -> db", "Publicly traded on NYSE (CMI) -> page (footer copyright, press releases)", "Products: engines, generators, transfer switches, switchgear, components -> db, page", "Engine types: diesel, natural gas, alternative fuel -> page", "Accelera zero-emission solutions -> page", "Components: emission solutions, automated transmissions, drivetrain/braking -> page", "9,000+ service locations worldwide -> page", "Headcount 1000+ at headquarters -> db", "Industries served: construction, power generation, marine, industrial -> db", "Mining sector 100-year milestone -> pag