UPDATE companies SET description='Custom Sheet Metal of Delaware, Inc. operates from Newport, Delaware, where it was founded in 1984 by Bill Wilson. Wilson began working in sheet metal at age 17, building a one-man enterprise that eventually outgrew smaller facilities and relocated to the current site. The company remains family-owned, now led by Wilson''s grandson Buddy Johnson as president, with his daughter Terry Johnson as office manager and Ron Faulkner as vice president and shop foreman.

The shop provides custom metal fabrication across industrial, commercial, and residential sectors. Its capabilities include shearing, braking, punching, welding, soldering, polishing, finishing, manual lathe turning, and bending, supplemented by CNC plasma cutting, laser cutting, waterjet cutting, and small-part powder coating. Equipment includes CNC press brakes, plasma systems, laser cutters, and waterjet machines, enabling work in steel, stainless steel, copper, and aluminum. The company handles projects ranging from single custom parts to runs of a thousand pieces.

Customers span industrial, commercial, and residential markets. Commercial clients receive precision shearing, laser, plasma, and waterjet cutting for project-specific requirements. Residential work covers similar cutting techniques for steel, stainless steel, copper, and aluminum. Industrial projects leverage the same advanced cutting technologies for precision and efficiency. The firm notes it has worked with hundreds of local companies.

The company emphasizes its legacy of excellence and modern equipment as differentiators. It states that no job is too big or too small, and that its cutting-edge machinery allows it to meet modern demands from concept to final product. The 90 years of combined team experience and family-run continuity are presented as foundations for quality and service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Shearing", "Braking (press brake)", "Punching", "Welding", "Soldering", "Polishing", "Finishing", "Manual lathe turning", "Metal bending", "CNC plasma cutting", "Laser cutting", "Waterjet cutting", "Powder coating (small parts)", "Custom parts fabrication", "Roof coping and flashing"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Commercial", "Residential"], "materials": ["Steel", "Stainless steel", "Copper", "Aluminum"], "equipment": ["CNC press brake", "CNC plasma cutting systems", "High-performance press brakes", "Precise laser cutting machines", "Versatile waterjet cutting technology"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No job too big or too small", "Cutting-edge equipment including CNC press brakes, plasma, laser, and waterjet systems", "Over 90 years of combined team experience", "Family-run continuity since 1984", "Locally owned and operated in Newport, Delaware"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1984 -> /about-us", "Founder Bill Wilson -> /about-us", "Family-owned, Buddy Johnson president -> /about-us", "Location Newport, Delaware -> / and /about-us", "Processes: shear, brake, punch, weld, solder, polish, finish, manual lathe, bending, CNC plasma, powder coating, laser, waterjet -> /", "Equipment: CNC press brake, CNC plasma, laser cutters, waterjet -> /", "Materials: steel, stainless steel, copper, aluminum -> /", "Industries: Industrial, Commercial, Residential -> /", "Team: Buddy Johnson, Ron Faulkner, Terry Johnson -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Based in Newport, Delaware, Custo